y, we must conclude:\n\n> **Answer ‘1’ is incorrect.**'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0154.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0155.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0156.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0157.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0158.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0159.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0160.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0161.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0162.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0163.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0164.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0165.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0166.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0167.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0168.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0169.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0170.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0171.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0172.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0173.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0174.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0175.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0176.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_0177.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/gbDR39yIs3Y/frames/frame_